OL,3,AReform's #72m donations 'entirely in
OL,4,Aline with law', Jenrick says
OL,5,
OL,6,FRayner says the Labour Party has
OL,7,F"strict rules" around donations, but
OL,8,Fadds that she doesn't know the
OL,9,Findividual circumstances of Reform's
OL,10,Fdonors
OL,12,FMeanwhile, asked about Donald Trump's
OL,13,Fcomments yesterday over a united
OL,14,FIreland, the shadow foreign secretary
OL,15,Fcalls them "completely wrong" and
OL,16,F"incredibly unhelpful"
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
