OL,3,APM's top security adviser says Europe
OL,4,Afaces hard winter to keep pressure on
OL,5,APutin
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK national security adviser has
OL,8,Fsaid Europe must be ready to endure
OL,9,F"real hardship" this winter if it is to
OL,10,Fkeep up economic pressure on Russia.
OL,12,FIn rare public remarks, Jonathan Powell
OL,13,Ftold a conference in Kyiv that Europe's
OL,14,Fstrategy of supporting Ukraine and
OL,15,Fimposing sanctions on Moscow was
OL,16,Fworking.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
