OL,3,AThey lost their jobs after posting
OL,4,Aabout Charlie Kirk, but some have no
OL,5,Aregrets
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn September 2025, Gerald Bourguet felt
OL,8,Fhe was finally living his dream life:
OL,9,Fhe and his wife had bought a house with
OL,10,Fa pool, they had just welcomed a baby
OL,11,Fboy, and he was writing about
OL,12,Fprofessional men's basketball as his
OL,13,Ffull-time job.
OL,15,FBut all of that changed after he made a
OL,16,Fseries of online posts critical of the
OL,17,Flate conservative activist Charlie Kirk
OL,18,Fhours after he was fatally shot on 10
OL,19,FSeptember, while speaking on the campus
OL,20,Fof Utah Valley University.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
PN,11912
SC,0012
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F119A1789300202
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs15j 5ws
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AThey lost their jobs after posting
OL,4,Aabout Charlie Kirk, but some have no
OL,5,Aregrets
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn the posts, Bourguet described Kirk
OL,8,Fas an "evil man" and suggested he had
OL,9,Fdedicated his life to hateful causes.
OL,10,FHe also criticised Kirk's supporters
OL,11,Fsaying they had not been vocal about
OL,12,Fschool shootings.
OL,14,F"I had seen the way that people were
OL,15,Ftalking about this person - kind of
OL,16,Feulogising him and lionising him and it
OL,17,Fbothered me based on a lot of the
OL,18,Fthings that he had said," Bourguet told
OL,19,Fthe BBC.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
