OL,3,ARussians seek answers over hundreds
OL,4,Amissing after Ukraine's 2024 incursion
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I used to have complete faith in our
OL,7,Fcountry," says Lyubov. The last time
OL,8,Fshe spoke to her mother was a day after
OL,9,FUkrainian forces broke into Russia's
OL,10,FKursk region more than two years ago.
OL,12,FNow she feels "resentful towards the
OL,13,F[Russian] state", in a country where
OL,14,Fmost people avoid criticising the
OL,15,Ffull-scale invasion unleashed on
OL,16,FUkraine in February 2022.
OL,18,FThe local governor says more than 300
OL,19,FRussians are still missing in Kursk
OL,20,Fregion, but no-one really knows the
OL,21,Ftrue figure.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
